    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Tree blights resemble ancient dead trees with twisted limbs and split hollows. Driven by bloodlust, they feed on living creatures, and the remains of past meals often hang tangled in their branches and roots. Tree blights work with other blights but attack any other tree-shaped creatures they meet, such as awakened trees and treants.</p>",
